<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australian 13-week T-note yield 5.894 pct.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australian 13-week T-note yield 5.894 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of Australia said the result of this week's T-note tender was as follows:</p>
<p> 13-week -    Amount	Av. yield   Range	 Previous</p>
<p>		  AS300 million   5.894	 5.88-5.90   5.885</p>
<p>		  (RBA take-up nil, pct allotted at top 40)</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
